    "description": "LAND FOR SALE!Builders,developers,investors-Approved plans w Building PERMITS ready for pick up! Buy Today,build tomorrow! TWO detached single-family homes at 245 and 235 Gellert Drive. Prime development opportunity on a 7,162 sq.ft. Lot Per architect.  245 Gellert Drive features 4-bedroom, 3.5-bath residence with a 1-bedroom, 1-bath ADU offering 3,018 sq. ft. of living space.     235 Gellert Drive features 5-bedroom, 4.5-bath home with family room and a study, spanning 3,023 sq. ft.    Located in the picturesque Lakeshore neighborhood Both homes will boast breathtaking views of Lake Merced and the surrounding  natural beauty from the expansive roof deck. This family friendly area is close proximity to Lakeshore Plaza, Stonestown Galleria,  the Olympic Club and top-rated schools like Lowell High School.  This is a wonderful and rare opportunity to build in one of San Francisco's most desirable neighborhoods!"
  },
